Z||000000||Ferrari_cdn||11-10-2001||02:43 AM||||I Was driving home at 1 in the morning, on a 3 lane highway  (Pembina).  I was in the middle lane and there was a car, about 2 cars length ahead of me on the right lane just about to stop and turn off.  I was quickly approaching him but there was this punk who was driving insanely fast, passing my right side and swerving into my lane, narrowly missing the car turning right and also narrowly missed my front fascia.  Those drivers should be shot!<P>It was a 60 kph road, so I got her up to 80 to chase this punk.  Got besides him, about a car behind and I think he doesn't want me so he sped up.  I try to keep up, already approaching 90.  Thats fast for a road like this highway, so I decided to just let this *******  go so I just quit and turn off at my intersection.  I don't know what car it is but it had similar shapes and lines of a Fiero.  It's not the NX, or MR2.  Just something else.<P>He could haev crashed either that other car or wrecked my car.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ferrari_cdn" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ferrari_cdn.JPG">  </A>  <BR>AIM: CanadianFiero||||reg||8
Z||000001||rogergarrison||11-10-2001||04:26 AM||||Know what you mean. Wed nite thislady trying to get ahead of everybody else kept switching lanes and cutting me off 3 times during rush hour. shed swerve into this lane, then get stuck and come back again. Almost hit me twice. I just kept following her till we got out of town, i never did change lanes once and still rite with her. when traffic thinned out she got stuck behind a semi in the slow lane and I just eased past her, got beside the semi and put it on cruise for 30 miles. She was fuming, LOL.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Back On Holiday||11-10-2001||08:21 AM||||Thurs Night I was driving home and I got behind a guy doing 5mph under the speed limit 40 in a 45 zone on a 4 lane divided highway, I went to pass nice and slow like 45-50 mph, and he punched it up to 65-70, by this time I was getting close to my exit and there were people tailgating behind me even though I was going 70 in a 45 zone, I had pull in front of him and get off the exit.  now, I know that's a bad thing to do...I could've caused an accident, and I'm not saying I was in the right. <BR>the guy leaned back and gave me a good old finger as I got off.  Man, he got me pissed.  here I was trying to pass and he floored it, guess he saw I was a sports car and wanted to race. if I had the option to pull back behind him, I would've - he prob would've slowed back down to 40mph again  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||1
