Z||000004||85 gt fiero||11-10-2001||08:06 PM||||I was driving my honda motorcycle down my road in the country i'm only sixteen so i had to be careful not to get caught and was doing 65 and a ford tempo pulled up to me and stayed in the other lane for like a mile i thought he was trying to pass but i guess not so i was nice enought to slow down to 40 to let him pass and he slowed down to 40 to, i had to turn left so i slowed down to about 15 to turn and he locked them up and cut in front of me right before i had to turn so i ended up giving him the one finger wave and for about an hour after that he keep driving by my house but stopped when he saw me waving with my paint ball gun <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> that was the last time i drove my bike on the road.<P>------------------<BR>RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES AND SOON TO BE BRIGHT YELLOW||||reg||1
